{%- comment -%}
  Static reviews — replaces the Okendo widget on the BOGO pages (bogo / senior / persona).
  Rendered from sections/product-alternatives-v2.liquid so it deploys with code, not template JSON.

  EDITING: one review per block below, fields separated by "||":
    Name || Date || Title || Body
  Date is optional: leave it empty and the date is hidden. Order = display order.
  The first 6 show; "Show More Reviews" reveals the rest 6 at a time.
{%- endcomment -%}

